{%- comment -%}
  The brass medallion from the back of the label — two concentric rings, one of
  them broken, with a short line of tracked caps inside.

  Accepts: top, middle, bottom (strings)
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="seal" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="seal__body">
    {%- if top != blank -%}<span class="seal__t">{{ top }}</span>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if middle != blank -%}<span class="seal__m">{{ middle }}</span>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if bottom != blank -%}<span class="seal__t">{{ bottom }}</span>{%- endif -%}
  </span>
</span>
